{"id": "90000022", "name": "תכונות המטריצה המצורפת – det(adj A), ו-adj(adj A) לפי det A", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\in M_{ {{CT:0}}\\times {{CT:0}} }(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det A={{CT:1}}\\)</span>. נסמן ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{adj}A\\)</span> את המטריצה המצורפת (השחלוף של מטריצת הקופקטורים).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\det\\left(\\operatorname{adj}A\\right)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\det\\left({{CT:2}}\\,A^{-1}\\operatorname{adj}A\\right)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span></div><p>מצאו מספר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> כך ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{adj}\\left(\\operatorname{adj}A\\right)=\\alpha A\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\alpha=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: בכל תיבה מספר שלם או שבר, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">-1/9</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> הכול נובע מהזהות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\cdot\\operatorname{adj}A=(\\det A)\\,I\\)</span>: לוקחים בה דטרמיננטה (סעיף א׳), מבטאים בעזרתה את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{adj}A\\)</span> כ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\((\\det A)A^{-1}\\)</span> (סעיף ב׳), ומפעילים אותה שוב על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{adj}A\\)</span> (סעיף ג׳).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הזהות הבסיסית</b><br>לכל מטריצה ריבועית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\cdot\\operatorname{adj}A=(\\det A)\\,I\\)</span> (פיתוח הדטרמיננטה לפי שורה). כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det A={{CT:1}}\\neq 0\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> הפיכה ו-<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\operatorname{adj}A=(\\det A)\\,A^{-1}={{CT:1}}\\,A^{-1} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — סעיף א׳</b><br>לוקחים דטרמיננטה בשני אגפי הזהות. עבור מטריצת היחידה מסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(\\lambda I)=\\lambda^{ {{CT:0}} }\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det A\\cdot\\det\\left(\\operatorname{adj}A\\right)=\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{ {{CT:0}} }={{CT:3}} \\]</p>ומכאן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det\\left(\\operatorname{adj}A\\right)=\\frac{ {{CT:3}} }{ {{CT:1}} }=\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{ {{CT:4}} }={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — סעיף ב׳</b><br>מציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{adj}A={{CT:1}}\\,A^{-1}\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\,A^{-1}\\operatorname{adj}A={{CT:6}}\\,A^{-2}\\)</span>. הוצאת סקלר מדטרמיננטה של מטריצה מסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> מעלה אותו בחזקת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span>, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det\\left(A^{-2}\\right)=(\\det A)^{-2}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det\\left({{CT:6}}\\,A^{-2}\\right)=\\left({{CT:6}}\\right)^{ {{CT:0}} }\\cdot\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{-2}={{CT:7}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 4 — סעיף ג׳</b><br>מפעילים את הזהות על המטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{adj}A\\)</span> (גם היא הפיכה, לפי סעיף א׳):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\operatorname{adj}\\left(\\operatorname{adj}A\\right)=\\det\\left(\\operatorname{adj}A\\right)\\left(\\operatorname{adj}A\\right)^{-1} \\]</p>לפי שלב 1, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(\\operatorname{adj}A\\right)^{-1}=\\left({{CT:1}}\\,A^{-1}\\right)^{-1}=\\frac{1}{ {{CT:1}} }A\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\operatorname{adj}\\left(\\operatorname{adj}A\\right)={{CT:5}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{ {{CT:1}} }A={{CT:8}}\\,A \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\alpha={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>[[feedback:prt3]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "t1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-0-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "w1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> זו הדטרמיננטה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((\\det A)I\\)</span>. לפי הזהות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det A\\cdot\\det(\\operatorname{adj}A)=(\\det A)^{ {{CT:0}} }\\)</span>, צריך עוד לחלק ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det A\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> קחו דטרמיננטה בשני אגפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\cdot\\operatorname{adj}A=(\\det A)I\\)</span>, וזכרו ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(\\lambda I)=\\lambda^{ {{CT:0}} }\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "t2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-0-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "w2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> את הסקלר מוציאים מהדטרמיננטה בחזקת סדר המטריצה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(\\lambda M)=\\lambda^{ {{CT:0}} }\\det M\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> הציבו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{adj}A=(\\det A)A^{-1}\\)</span> וקבלו כפולה בסקלר של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^{-2}\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "t3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-0-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-0-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b> הפעילו את הזהות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(M\\cdot\\operatorname{adj}M=(\\det M)I\\)</span> על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(M=\\operatorname{adj}A\\)</span>, והיעזרו בסעיף א׳ ובשלב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{adj}A=(\\det A)A^{-1}\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["c", "cn", "dd", "dn", "n", "t1", "t2", "t3", "w1", "w2"], "nvariants": 40}